<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Strict//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-strict.dtd">
<html>
<head>
	<meta content="text/html;charset=utf-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
	<title>Intel Registration Confirmation</title>
	<style>
		/* Font Definitions */ @font-face {
			font-family: "Intel Clear";
			panose-1: 2 11 5 4 2 2 2 2 2 4;
			mso-font-charset: 0;
			mso-generic-font-family: swiss;
			mso-font-pitch: variable;
			mso-font-signature: 3 0 0 0 1 0;
		}
		/* Style Definitions */

		a {
			color: #003C71;
			font-family: "Intel Clear","TAHOMA" !important;
		}
		p.uppercase {
			text-transform: uppercase;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; background-color:#f9f9f9;background: url('https://tstcqcontent-ssl.cps.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/gradiantbg-body.png') repeat-x scroll left top #f9f9f9;      height: 100%;      outline: medium none;">
<table style="background-color: #ffffff; margin: 0 50px; overflow: hidden; width: 550pt; line-height: 20px; border: 1px solid #E5E5E5;">
<tbody>
<tr style="height: 320px;">
<td colspan="2" style="color: #086db6; font-size: 24pt; padding-top: 50px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-left: 50px; font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; height: 320px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear Pro','TAHOMA'; color: #003c71; font-size: 28pt;"><img src="https://messagecenter.intel.com/v1/images/uploads/34749eb0-3742-11ec-9e86-55b8d111e922.png" alt="" title="devzone-premier-header_720x160@2x.png" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px; height: 17px;"><hr style="background-color: #e5e5e5; color: #e5e5e5; border: 0 none; height: 1px;" /></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 20px;">
<td colspan="2" id="emailMainDiv" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 30px; height: 20px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;"><b style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #086db6; font-size: 10pt;">Hello {!PRM_Registration_Request__c.PRM_First_Name__c} {!PRM_Registration_Request__c.PRM_Last_Name__c},</b></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailBody" style="height: 152px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 15px; padding-right: 50px; height: 152px;">
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Thank you for your interest in Developer Zone Premier. After reviewing your application, it was determined that your project did not meet the requirements for a Developer Zone Premier account. We regret to inform you that your request for Premier access has been denied.</p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;"></p></br>
<p style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;">You may continue to use your Standard account to access public content in the Developer Zone. If you feel your request was declined in error, please use the “Need Help?” link on our Developer Zone Premier registration form.</p>
<p style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><span></span></p></br>
<p style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;"><span>Additionally, we have several resellers that you may wish to engage with for resource help with your project.  </span><span>  </span></p>
<ul>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel Solutions Document Library</em>: <a href="https://builders.intel.com/solutionslibrary">https://builders.intel.com/solutionslibrary</a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>For product and pricing related questions, please contact your Motherboard OEM, Intel Authorized Distributors (IAD) or Intel Authorized Supplier (IAS). You can locate a list of IAD or IAS at: </em><a href="https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/partner/where-to-buy/overview.html">https://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/partner/where-to-buy/overview.html</a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>For Intel Programs information and support:</em><a href="https://www.intel.com/partner-alliance">https://www.intel.com/partner-alliance</a> </span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>For product information:</em><u></u><a href="https://ark.intel.com/">https://ark.intel.com/</a> </span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Software &amp; Drivers download center:</em><strong></strong><a href="https://downloadcenter.intel.com/">https://downloadcenter.intel.com/</a> </span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel Community:</em><em></em><a href="https://community.intel.com/">https://community.intel.com/</a> </span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel Solutions Marketplace catalog:</em> <a href="https://marketplace.intel.com/">https://marketplace.intel.com/</a><a href="https://marketplace.intel.com/"></a></span></li>
<li><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;"><em>Intel Customer Support: </em><a href="https://www.intel.com/support">https://www.intel.com/support</a> </span></li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">We appreciate your patience and sincerely apologize if your request may have taken longer than usual to process.</p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666; font-size: 10pt;">Thank you for your interest in Intel.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr id="salutationDiv" style="padding-bottom: 5px; height: 52px;">
<td colspan="2" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 10pt; color: #666666; padding-left: 50px; padding-top: 14px; line-height: 18px; height: 52px;">
<p>Kindest Regards,<br />Intel Corporation<br />Intel.com, Intel Privacy Notice, Intel Cookie Notice</p>
<p></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 52.6667px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 50px; padding-right: 110px; padding-top: 25px; line-height: 18px; height: 52.6667px;">
<p style="margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #62686e;"><span style="font-family: calibri; font-size: 11pt;">Please DO NOT reply to this e-mail message. This is an automated response. To ensure that you continue receiving our e-mails, add us to your address book. </span><br /> <br /><br /></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 17px;">
<td colspan="2" style="padding-left: 40px; padding-right: 40px; padding-top: 15px; height: 17px;" align="center"><hr style="background-color: #e5e5e5; color: #e5e5e5; border: 0 none; height: 1px;" /></td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailFooter" style="height: 32px;">
<td style="padding-left: 50px; font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 9pt; line-height: 16px; color: #666666; padding-top: 13px; height: 32px;">Intel is committed to protecting your privacy. For more Information, <br /> please see the <a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-privacy-notice.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important; outline: none;">Intel Privacy Notice.</a> <a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/privacy/intel-cookie-notice.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important; outline: none;">Intel Cookie Notice.</a></td>
<td rowspan="2" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; padding-top: 10px; height: 48px;">
<div style="margin-right: -20px;"><img hspace="0px;" src="http://www.intel.com/etc/designs/intel/us/en/images/myIntelLogo.jpg" height="62px" /></div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr id="emailFooter2" style="height: 16px;">
<td style="padding-left: 50px; font-family: 'Intel Clear', TAHOMA; font-size: 9pt; color: #666666; padding-top: 14px; line-height: 16px; height: 16px;"><a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/terms-of-use.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important;">Legal Information</a> | <a href="http://www.intel.com/content/www/us/en/legal/trademarks.html" style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; text-decoration: none; color: #086db6 !important; outline: none;">Trademarks</a> | <span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; color: #666666;">©</span> <span style="font-family: 'Intel Clear','TAHOMA'; font-size: 9pt; color: #666666;">Intel Corporation.</span></td>
</tr>
<tr style="height: 10px;">
<td style="display: none; height: 10px;"> </td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</body>
</html>